          <td bgcolor="black" class="text"> 
            <b>Vendui Horde -<br>
<br>
After last week's successful pillaging of the Giants Stronghold in Velious, Kael Drakkel, we walked away with numerous pieces of ancient armours that the filthy Ice Dorfs wish to barter for finely crafted armor.  Greedy shortlings they are, also demanding a tithe of rare gems for each piece. Their greed will end in their blood one day, but not today - we require the armors and will, for the time being, barter it with them. After all - we can always kill them for the gems after we've recieved our armors.<br>
<br>
Thus the Horde now moves to uncover the treasures deep within the Siren's Grotto, beyond the Cobalt scar in Velious. We shall restock our guild gem bank and leave a trail of destruction in our wake!!!!<br>
<br>
-ooc-<br>
<font color="white">Sirens Grotto Gem collecting raid this Thursday, January 23rd. All Gems will go to the guild bank to be distributed to those who collect the armour pieces for the various Velious armors.  Click <a href="http://eqdiva.com/maps/default.asp?map=siren" target="_blank">here for maps of the zone</a>. Things should get rolling at roughly 9pm EST, and ports will be avaialbe to Cobalt scar , please meet in the Nexus if you need a port.  There are also some nice and easily obtained Enduring Breath Items in the zone.<br>
<br>
Please post a reply if you will be able to attend the hunt, as well as any questions you might have about the zone or the hunt!<br>
<br>
